---
// A page to write on: its contents stacked top to bottom, filling the page's
// height, with whatever grows (ruled lines, a box, a grid) taking the space
// the rest leaves.
//
// Every component in this folder is sized in `em`, so a page is drawn at
// whatever scale its font size sets — `MiniZine` sets one tenth of a printed
// inch — and the same parts work on any printable that sets a font size.
---

<div class="page"><slot /></div>

<style>
  .page {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5em;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: var(--text);
  }
</style>
